OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThundery
OL,6,Fshowers fading by the late evening,
OL,7,Fwith a dry and mostly clear night
OL,8,Ffollowing. Feeling rather chilly, with
OL,9,Frural frost and localised fog forming
OL,10,Finland by dawn.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FA dry day across the region
OL,13,Fwith sunny spells for many. Light
OL,14,Fwinds and still feeling rather chilly,
OL,15,Fdespite the sunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
