OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FA
OL,6,Fchilly start with patchy frost and fog
OL,7,Fon Sunday, remaining dry and bright.
OL,8,FCloudier into Monday, and a chance of
OL,9,Fthe odd shower. More unsettled
OL,10,FTuesday. Temperatures nearer average.
